# .git IS sent as build context (not excluded) -- the Dockerfile's build stage reads it to
# derive the Settings > Info card's commit/branch. It's copied into a build-stage layer only
# and discarded before the final image, so it never ends up in what actually ships.

# Never copied by the Dockerfile (it takes only the sln, the csproj files, src/
# and the entrypoint) -- listed so they aren't uploaded as build context either.
docs/
examples/
icon/
tools/
.github/
.config/
